# GitHub Governance & Client Repository Sync Flow (Version 1)

## Objective

Automatically send approved content from the source repository to a client repository using GitHub Actions.

Current Proof of Concept:

* Source Repository: `raconsys-governance-lab/project-demo`
* Client Repository: `Amit96-dev/client-repo-test`
* Trigger: Push to `main`
* Test File: `README.md`

---

# Architecture

```text
Developer
    ↓
Feature Branch
    ↓
Pull Request
    ↓
Approval
    ↓
Merge To Main
    ↓
GitHub Action Triggered
    ↓
Clone Client Repository
    ↓
Copy Required Files
    ↓
Commit Changes
    ↓
Push To Client Repository
```

