# Secret Storage

Repository:

```text
project-demo
```

Location:

```text
Settings
→ Secrets and Variables
→ Actions
```

Secret Name:

```text
CLIENT_REPO_TOKEN
```

Purpose:

```text
Store PAT securely.
Never expose token in code.
```

---

# GitHub Action Flow

Workflow:

```text
.github/workflows/client-sync.yml
```

Trigger:

```yaml
on:
  push:
    branches:
      - main
```

Meaning:

```text
Whenever main changes,
run the workflow.
```

---

# Runtime Flow

Step 1

GitHub detects:

```text
Push to main
```

Step 2

GitHub creates temporary runner:

```text
Ubuntu VM
```

Step 3

Runner checks out source repository:

```text
project-demo
```

Step 4

Runner clones:

```text
Amit96-dev/client-repo-test
```

using:

```text
CLIENT_REPO_TOKEN
```

Step 5

Runner copies files:

```text
README.md
```

Step 6

Runner commits changes.

Step 7

Runner pushes changes.

Step 8

Runner is destroyed.

